---@field default? kubernetes.core.IoK8sApiCoreV1LimitRangeItemDefaultMap default specifies resource limit values by resource name. These are applied to containers which do not specify their own limits for those resources.
---@field defaultRequest? kubernetes.core.IoK8sApiCoreV1LimitRangeItemDefaultRequestMap defaultRequest specifies resource request values by resource name. These are applied to containers which do not specify their own requests for those resources.
---@field max? kubernetes.core.IoK8sApiCoreV1LimitRangeItemMaxMap max usage constraints on this kind by resource name.
---@field maxLimitRequestRatio? kubernetes.core.IoK8sApiCoreV1LimitRangeItemMaxLimitRequestRatioMap maxLimitRequestRatio if specified, the named resource must have a request and limit that are both non-zero where limit divided by request is less than or equal to the enumerated value; this represents the max burst for the named resource.
---@field min? kubernetes.core.IoK8sApiCoreV1LimitRangeItemMinMap min usage constraints on this kind by resource name.
---@field type string type of resource that this limit applies to.

---default specifies resource limit values by resource name. These are applied to containers which do not specify their own limits for those resources.
