---@field bootID string bootID reported by the node.
---@field containerRuntimeVersion string containerRuntimeVersion reported by the node through runtime remote API (e.g. containerd://1.4.2).
---@field kernelVersion string kernelVersion is kernel Version reported by the node from 'uname -r' (e.g. 3.16.0-0.bpo.4-amd64).
