---@field metadata? kubernetes.core.IoK8sApimachineryPkgApisMetaV1ObjectMeta metadata is the standard object's metadata. If the Labels of a ReplicationController are empty, they are defaulted to be the same as the Pod(s) that the replication controller manages. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#metadata
