---@field status? kubernetes.core.IoK8sApiCoreV1ReplicationControllerStatus status is the most recently observed status of the replication controller. This data may be out of date by some window of time. Populated by the system. Read-only. More info: https://git.k8s.io/community/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#spec-and-status

---ReplicationControllerCondition describes the state of a replication controller at a certain point.
