---@class kubernetes.core.PatchCoreV1NamespaceRequest
---@field name string name of the Namespace
---@field pretty? string If 'true', then the output is pretty printed. Defaults to 'false' unless the user-agent indicates a browser or command-line HTTP tool (curl and wget).
